{"type":"queue-operation","operation":"enqueue","timestamp":"2026-09-20T07:32:30.534Z","sessionId":"842f520e-0b0f-4b3d-9120-1d366a04d2cb","content":"You are judging candidate connections in a personal knowledge base.\n\nEach candidate below is a pair of articles that are NOT currently linked but\nshare neighbours in the wikilink graph. Structural proximity is only a hint -\nyour job is to decide whether a real, non-obvious relationship exists.\n\nREJECT when:\n- the two articles are merely about the same topic or domain\n- the relationship is obvious from the titles alone\n- a connection article would only restate what either article already says\n- the shared neighbours are generic infrastructure both happen to touch\n\nACCEPT only when a reader who already knew BOTH articles would still learn\nsomething from the relationship being made explicit - a shared root cause, a\ntransferable technique, a tension between two approaches, a pattern that\nrecurs across different domains.\n\nBe strict. Rejecting most candidates is the expected and correct outcome.\n\n## Articles you may [[wikilink]]\n\n- concepts/accidental-git-init-home-directory\n- concepts/advisor-invocation-failure-modes\n- concepts/applied-performance-biweekly-status-report\n- concepts/applied-performance-okr-system\n- concepts/arguable-threshold-design\n- concepts/at-utilization-benchmarks-project\n- concepts/ath-medicine-project\n- concepts/athlete-monitoring-rtp-presentation\n- concepts/athletics-performance-landing-page-spec\n- concepts/automated-layout-qa-gate\n- concepts/automation-stack-doctor\n- concepts/background-monitor-signal-reliability\n- concepts/backup-error-log-recurring-failures-2026-08-16\n- concepts/backup-manifest-coverage-gap-2026-09-09\n- concepts/backup-manifest-drift-and-launchd-status-lag\n- concepts/backup-manifest-symlink-false-alarm\n- concepts/backup-oom-kill-during-first-time-index\n- concepts/backup-status-ok-versus-job-count\n- concepts/backup-verification-by-restore\n- concepts/baylor-fall-camp-deliverable-lockdown\n- concepts/baylor-fall-camp-macro-load-model\n- concepts/baylor-fall-camp-practice-planning-model\n- concepts/baylor-load-simulator-comparison-view\n- concepts/baylor-load-simulator-deployment\n- concepts/baylor-load-simulator-fall-camp-mode\n- concepts/baylor-performance-clinic-presentation\n- concepts/baylor-software-tech-doc-set-finalization\n- concepts/baylor-tech-inventory-analysis\n- concepts/baylor-wtn-acwr-analysis\n- concepts/book-advisor-system\n- concepts/browser-automation-stack-audit-mac\n- concepts/bu-cheer-summer-2026-training\n- concepts/canonical-section-relocation-inbound-pointers\n- concepts/carryover-only-email-digest\n- concepts/catapult-connect-api-reference\n- concepts/catapult-period-aggregation-sync-policy\n- concepts/cfb-victory-model-evaluation\n- concepts/claude-ai-skill-porting\n- concepts/claude-code-cli-marketplace-setup\n- concepts/claude-code-environment-maintenance\n- concepts/claude-code-memory-architecture\n- concepts/claude-code-meta-skills-bundle\n- concepts/claude-code-permission-modes\n- concepts/claude-code-remote-control-config\n- concepts/claude-code-statusline-configuration\n- concepts/claude-code-token-dashboard\n- concepts/claude-code-worktree-gotchas\n- concepts/claude-memory-compiler-setup\n- concepts/clear-the-error-log-only-after-a-clean-run\n- concepts/clinical-note-nlp-clustering\n- concepts/clipboard-image-paste-claude-code\n- concepts/closeout-scope-discipline-other-sessions-work\n- concepts/coach-report-prototype-flag-rule\n- concepts/codex-adversarial-verification\n- concepts/codex-path-rewrite-incident\n- concepts/committed-symlink-repo-landmine\n- concepts/compiler-backlog-hook-notice\n- concepts/contextvault-memory-onboarding\n- concepts/crashbox-ssd-backup-baseline\n- concepts/cross-machine-conflict-file-triage\n- concepts/cross-provider-review-gate\n- concepts/custom-claude-code-skills\n- concepts/daily-onramp-automation\n- concepts/dcg-guard-false-positives-nat